Subject: [PATCH] Enable capabilities on an App ID through the developer
 services v1 API

DeveloperPortal.enableCapabilities(_:for:team:session:) sends the PATCH
of services/v1/bundleIds/<id> that Xcode sends, with bundleIdCapabilities
relationships. A free team cannot turn on Increased Memory Limit through
updateAppId.action, but it can through this request, which is how
GetMoreRam and AltStore 2.3 get it (SideStore#1616).

